WEBVTT


1
00:00:00.960 --> 00:00:05.120
Hello. I am Stephen Wavers, president of the Federation of

2
00:00:05.160 --> 00:00:09.040
European Fire Officers, a network representing fire service

3
00:00:09.040 --> 00:00:11.760
leaders in the 24 European countries.

4
00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:16.960
As FEU president, I am delighted to offer our support for

5
00:00:16.960 --> 00:00:21.240
this new European campaign, namely European Smoke Alarm

6
00:00:21.240 --> 00:00:24.720
Day. It's a great addition to the programme of events

7
00:00:24.720 --> 00:00:27.080
organised for European Fire Safety Week,

8
00:00:27.280 --> 00:00:32.440
and is a very worthwhile campaign which help to save lives

9
00:00:32.440 --> 00:00:33.920
all over Europe.

10
00:00:35.080 --> 00:00:38.480
And this campaign, organised by the European Fire Safety

11
00:00:38.480 --> 00:00:43.360
Alliance, has the potential to directly impact the lives of

12
00:00:43.400 --> 00:00:46.480
500 million citizens in Europe.

13
00:00:47.400 --> 00:00:51.280
And this campaign is in keeping with the aims of the FEU,

14
00:00:51.520 --> 00:00:55.040
namely, the improvement of fire safety awareness and

15
00:00:55.040 --> 00:00:59.080
sharing the best of practice within European member states.

16
00:01:00.120 --> 00:01:03.800
So I would like to congratulate everyone involved in

17
00:01:03.800 --> 00:01:07.800
organising this campaign, and I can assure you that we will

18
00:01:07.800 --> 00:01:11.080
do everything we can as fire service around Europe,

19
00:01:11.080 --> 00:01:15.000
to encourage more citizens to install smoke alarms in their

20
00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:20.240
homes. So I encourage our fire service colleagues around

21
00:01:20.240 --> 00:01:24.160
Europe to support this campaign and help to make it a

22
00:01:24.160 --> 00:01:29.520
success. And it's very important because smoke alarms saves

23
00:01:29.520 --> 00:01:32.000
lives. So do it.